### Aegis API requests: run with the green ▶ next to each request in IntelliJ.
### App must be running on port 8081 (dev profile). Run "Login" first.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Login: saves the token for the requests below
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"temporary-password"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Create a document: saves its id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Hello","content":"First doc"}

> {% client.global.set("docId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. List (paged, sorted, filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?page=0&size=10&sort=title,asc&q=hel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"New title","content":"Updated"}

### 6. Delete (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. No token → expect 401 JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents

### 8. Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
